-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a7e54ea3099505a7e","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a513ce3b392834fe0"}
{"parentUuid":"8ffcc2fd-4f4c-4a19-a736-9e5d5826a2f5","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"0e75e1c2-9f84-43c4-8006-cccad7102c77","agentId":"a7e54ea3099505a7e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BAXKYvRQWvZZ4p2LLxWw4c","type":"tool_result","content":"06e5664 cursor: stop-block-continuation unsupported, recorded in runs/stop-block-continuation (#94)\n8b0dec5 codex, cursor: schedule-wakeup unsupported, recorded in runs/schedule-wakeup-ask (#93)\nfca6d74 capabilities: empty-tool-result-placeholder unsupported on codex and cursor, shown by shell-exit-status runs (#92)\nstatement: >-\n  When a sub-agent-stop hook blocks, the sub-agent runs again with the hook's\n  reason as feedback, until the hook lets it stop or the block cap is reached.\n  The feedback is recorded in the sub-agent's own transcript.\nproviders:\n  claude:\n    docs:\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#subagentstop\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#subagentstop-input\n      - https://code.claude.com/docs/en/hooks#decision-control\n    runs:\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/cap-sub\n      - claude-mock/snapshots/runs/hookmix\n  codex: pending\n  cursor: pending\ncommit f860ff366b50328d62a3ff06a1cd76d39e84245f\nAuthor: Mykyta Svyrydenko <<redacted-email>>\nDate:   Sat Oct 3 16:44:15 2026 +0200\n\n    codex: bash-tool-result cell supported, recorded in runs/shell-exit-status (#91)\n    \n    Codex tells the agent a failed command's output like a success's; the failure is only in the event stream's command_execution item (status failed, exit_code). Recorded with the real codex; the cell lists that as a deviation, and the mock does the same.\n    \n    Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/shell_result_test.go      | 72 ++++++++++++++++++++++\n codex-mock/internal/events/stream.go               |  7 ++-\n .../snapshots/runs/shell-exit-status/run.yaml      |  2 +\n .../shell-exit-status/samples/20261003-