.go, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/run.yaml, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/SEAL, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/events.jsonl, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/exit.txt, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/payloads.jsonl, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/stderr.txt, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/stream.jsonl (and 18 more) (file-guard \"capability-rigor\")\n  - The Codex doc lists source values startup, resume, clear and compact, but the deviation only declares resume, fork and compact as unmodeled, so the doc variant \"clear\" has no test and no deviation. Also, TestSessionStartSaysStartupAndCannotStopTheSession never checks the SessionStart matcher-on-source filtering shown in runs/hook-matchers (session-startup ran, session-resume did not).\nThe files this refusal is about: codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/subagent_stop_test.go, codex-mock/internal/runner/agent_host.go, codex-mock/internal/runner/run.go, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/run.yaml, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/SEAL, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/events.jsonl, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/exit.txt, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/payloads.jsonl, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/stderr.txt, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/stream.jsonl (and 18 more) (file-guard \"capability-rigor\")\n  - The test covers the recorded block loop (JSON block, then exit 2, then stop, with feedback only in the sub-agent rollout), but the doc says a SubagentStop hook returning continue:false takes precedence over block decisions and no test exercises that. Nothing checks that agent_transcript_path in the SubagentStop payload points at the sub-agent rollout holding the feedback.\nThe files this refusal is about: codex-mock/e2e/001_hooks/subagent_stop_test.go, codex-mock/internal/runner/agent_host.go, codex-mock/internal/runner/run.go, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/run.yaml, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/SEAL, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/events.jsonl, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/exit.txt, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/payloads.jsonl, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/stderr.txt, codex-mock/snapshots/runs/subagent-stop-block-loop/samples/20261003-151437/stream.jsonl (and 18 more) (file-guard \"capability-rigor\")","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"5329dca9-aee3-4b9e-885a-799a40b220ab","timestamp":"2026-10-03T15:32:07.154Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"51d9127d-eeac-4662-8dba-195c21c2d98f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a7e54ea3099505a7e","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a7e54ea3099505a7e"}
