{"parentUuid":"4631288c-790e-466b-be0e-5660bdbf2b20","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"a7e54ea3099505a7e","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cffi74w6e328tkXnmNxYU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Both cells are resolved and PR #118 is merged. CI was all green and `sr-checks` printed no refusals on the final head.\n\n- **codex x subagent-stop-block-loop: supported.**\n  - **Recordings:** the real `codex` re-ran the sub-agent after each `SubagentStop` block, whether by JSON decision or exit 2, and recorded each reason in the sub-agent's own rollout. Two runs show it: `subagent-stop-block-loop` (blocked twice, then let it stop) and `subagent-stop-block-loop-cap` (15 blocks in a row, all honoured).\n  - **Cell:** it cites the frozen hooks doc at `#subagentstop`. Its one deviation, under `capability-grounding`, is that Codex shows no block cap for sub-agent stops.\n  - **Adapter:** I built it on the `spawn_agent` code that #106 had already landed, without duplicating it. `agent_host.go` now reads the stop hook's block and records the feedback. `agent_stop.go` handles `continue:false` outranking a block, which comes from the docs, not a recording.\n  - **Tests:** the e2e tests are in `subagent_stop_test.go` and `subagent_stop_continue_test.go`, marked `sr:proves subagent-stop-block-loop/codex`.\n  - **Wiring:** following your note, I left `run.go` untouched, so the noninteractive-run refusal no longer applies.\n- **cursor x subagent-stop-block-loop: unsupported.** In the run `subagent-stop-block-loop` (captured with the 2026.09.28 build), the sub-agent ran and answered, but neither `subagentStart` nor `subagentStop` fired in print mode. The cell cites that run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":181,"cache_read_input_tokens":233183,"output_tokens":587,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":181},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":587,"cache_read_input_tokens":233183,"cache_creation_input_tokens":181,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":181,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011Cffi74eV7P8ypTtpnNy8a","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"146bc78d-af93-402c-a4ef-5f41a5cacec3","timestamp":"2026-10-03T17:37:06.931Z","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/nsviridenko/ws/sloprail/harness-mocks/.claude/worktrees/agent-a7e54ea3099505a7e","sessionId":"f103aecd-8ff6-40a5-ad21-f5bd02338666","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"worktree-agent-a54d95a1b2ce35f6b"}
